# Ruleset: Vercel
#
# Expects a proxy policy.
#
# Blob storage lives in Direct/Download.list.
#
# The address rules cover the Vercel CLI, which dials Vercel's anycast space without a name. They classify those requests even if the cause of a failed connection lies elsewhere.

DOMAIN-SUFFIX,now.sh
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,vercel-insights.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,vercel-scripts.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,vercel-status.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,vercel.app
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,vercel.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,vercel.sh
IP-CIDR,64.239.109.0/24,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,64.239.123.0/24,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,76.76.21.0/24,no-resolve
